ment, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Perl."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/2bde42ae-e776-41c1-9ded-b07b30bfe985", "label": "Prolog (computer programming)", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Prolog."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6417a4cc-6f61-4459-a114-761a7fa0279d", "label": "Puppet (tools for software configuration management)", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The tool Puppet is a software program to perform configuration identification, control, status accounting and audit."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ccd0a1d9-afda-43d9-b901-96344886e14d", "label": "Python (computer programming)", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Python."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/51586df8-1c46-4b47-8583-773cb63bf00b", "label": "R", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in R."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/0ccdfe98-f845-4598-84a1-3dca66e9d9a3", "label": "Ruby (computer programming)", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Ruby."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/bb99af26-71ff-4dca-bde7-1eb1f6194426", "label": "SAP R3", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in SAP R3."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/04f1b938-d4d4-4cb1-a863-982af76b9d93", "label": "SAS language", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in SAS language."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/af7ae54f-4649-4c16-87c7-59ba41d4d57f", "label": "SPARK", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The Java micro framework software development environment which provide specific features and components that support and guide web applications development."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/598de5b0-5b58-4ea7-8058-a4bc4d18c742", "label": "SQL", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The computer language SQL is a query language for retrieval of information from a database and of documents containing the needed information. It is developed by the American National Standards Institute and the International Organization for Standardization."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/69f0167e-75d9-46cf-847f-72a592880ebb", "label": "STAF", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The tool STAF is a software program to perform configuration identification, control, status accounting and audit."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c7451027-8249-405a-bb1b-342ff0f3fb3b", "label": "Salt (tools for software configuration management)", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The tool Salt is a software program to perform configuration identification, control, status accounting and audit."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ffddfc7c-a9dd-449f-9e96-882dc447c8b6", "label": "Scala", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Scala."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d56fc2b5-4b0a-4e7e-9bde-a33736f6ff18", "label": "Scratch (computer programming)", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Scratch."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/42ed3bfb-1a01-4c8b-9758-fc6438865734", "label": "Smalltalk (computer programming)", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Smalltalk."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/be80acfc-b6f2-4411-9b8d-b19d9cd2556a", "label": "Swift (computer programming)", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Swift."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/867137fb-ff1b-4ca3-99f3-cb6969aa2c68", "label": "TypeScript", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in TypeScript."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/dcdd5ddf-82a6-4ac3-8edc-d4b23cae9a88", "label": "VBScript", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in VBScript."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/13bdd41a-2a18-441f-96db-41252c519413", "label": "Visual Basic", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Visual Basic."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6d289e8b-2cc1-4eda-ab1f-ad1090ef98f0", "label": "WordPress", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The open-source web-based software systems used for creating, editing, publishing and archiving blogs, articles, web pages or press releases which are mostly managed by users with limited web programming knowledge."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/8696aff0-18c0-4ba6-a4d0-9a21861b3e5e", "label": "World Wide Web Consortium standards", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The standards, technical specifications and guidelines developed by the international organisation World Wide Web Consortium (W3C) which allow the design and development of web applications."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/449d119b-2d66-43a9-9230-7d27f16afbb6", "label": "Xcode", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The computer program Xcode is a suite of software development tools for writing programs, such as compiler, debugger, code editor, code highlights, packaged in a unified user interface. It is developed by the software company Apple."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f5308e60-d763-4ead-be95-88c96fb3e02b", "label": "adapt to changes in technological development plans", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Modify the current design and development activities of technological projects to meet changes in requests or strategies. Ensure that the organisation''s or client''s needs are met and that any sudden requests which were not previously planned are implemented."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/3c2e6f38-42c1-46ec-b782-5854b2db330d", "label": "blockchain openness", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The different levels of openness of a blockchain, their differences, and their advantages and disadvantages. Examples are permissionless, permissioned, and hybrid blockchains."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/9035afc4-5317-455d-ab60-f32e2ecc6bfc", "label": "blockchain platforms", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The different integrated infrastructures, each with their own characteristics, that allow the development of blockchain applications. Examples are multichain, ehtereum, hyperledger, corda, ripple, openchain, etc."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/71746a0b-e58d-4dc4-ad03-bd84082eae21", "label": "collect customer feedback on applications", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Gather a response and analyse data from customers to identify requests or problems in order to improve applications and overall customer satisfaction."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/5898d99a-62a4-4e10-a2e3-0d815ce44248", "label": "cyber attack counter-measures", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "Methods, technologies and techniques used to defend (detect, monitor and recover) against cyber attacks. These cyber attacks include several attack vectors such as malware, denial of service (DoS) attacks and phishing. Intrusion prevention systems (IPS), firewall, antivirus, intrusion detection systems (IDS), cybersecurity training, backup, Information Security Management System (ISM), multi-factor authentication and employ awareness, are some examples of the methods used."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/65e58886-bd1e-4c5b-8ca5-8d9b353c8aa1", "label": "data visualisation software", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "A computer tool or application that creates a graphical and visual representation of data, allowing a better understanding and interpretation of complex data through visual elements such as maps, charts, infographics or graphs."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/17924c75-45f4-4593-afac-eea0d51f04b5", "label": "defence standard procedures", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "Methods and procedures typical for defence applications such as the NATO Standardization Agreements or STANAGs\nStandard definitions of the processes, procedures, terms, and conditions for common military or technical procedures or equipment. Guidelines for capability planners, programme managers and test managers to prescribe the necessary technical standards and profiles to achieve interoperability of Communications and Information Systems."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/fd33c66c-70c4-40e6-b87c-5495bd3bf26e", "label": "design user interface", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Create software or device components which enable interaction between humans and systems or machines, using appropriate techniques, languages and tools so as to streamline interaction while using the system or machine."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/8c4c49d4-9708-433f-8ca7-bf2c5211ee49", "label": "develop creative ideas", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Developing new artistic concepts and creative ideas."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/38716afc-a93b-44ab-96cc-2ecf67edcf32", "label": "do cloud refactoring", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Optimise application to best use cloud services and features, migrate existing application code to run on cloud infrastructure."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ed8de897-adbe-4f0e-b4d2-534953e64c72", "label": "integrate system components", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Select and use integration techniques and tools to plan and implement integration of hardware and software modules and components in a system."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/020918ef-4b55-47c1-8430-ab7b8f6a7377", "label": "migrate existing data", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Apply migration and conversion methods for existing data, in order to transfer or convert data between formats, storage or computer systems."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/5be3d306-6cf1-4b49-aa1d-01651dd4ba4c", "label": "object-oriented modelling", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The object-oriented paradigm, which is based on classes, objects, methods and interfaces and their application in software design and analysis, programming organisation and techniques."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/1774bd31-8893-44cf-9498-7e3d95508419", "label": "screen reader", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "Software program which converts screen elements such as text, images, or buttons, displayed in the computer into Braille or speech. Assistive technology used by visually impaired or blind people to interpret what appears on the computer screen through braille output, audio icons or speech synthesisers."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/670f8eea-f25b-4c3f-97ef-a4729d4c63d6", "label": "smart contract", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "A software program in which the terms of a contract or transaction are directly coded. Smart contracts are executed automatically upon fulfilment of the terms and therefore require no third party to oversee and register the contract or transaction."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/438ff259-d086-4004-acda-1ec3e1631bc6", "label": "software anomalies", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The deviations of what is standard and exceptional events during software system performance, identification of incidents that can alter the flow and the process of system execution."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/24c200e5-be20-4370-a137-ab53797f3a17", "label": "software frameworks", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The software development environments or tools used to improve the efficiency of new software development by providing specific features that support and guide the development."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ba1b0441-a6b8-4e57-8ccc-871012f63e42", "label": "trading software", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The finance and trading integrated software solutions."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7d10fcb2-b368-48ab-996b-7c9fafcf68ed", "label": "use automatic programming", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Utilise specialised software tools to generate computer code from specifications, such as diagrams, structured informations or other means of describing functionality."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/25b291b5-8245-4d9d-b391-86a8a31d7109", "label": "use concurrent programming", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Utilise specialised ICT tools to create programs that can execute concurrent operations by splitting programs into parallel processes and, once computed, combining the outcomes together."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d31fab87-2a7d-485c-b699-2901ca294b15", "label": "use functional programming", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Utilise specialised ICT tools to create computer code which treats computation as the evaluation of mathematical functions and seeks to avoid state and mutable data. Use programming languages which support this method such as LISP, PROLOG and Haskell."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/2c4e11ef-da18-4e19-816b-e6bc19e12424", "label": "use logic programming", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Utilise specialised ICT tools to create computer code composed of series of sentences in logical form, expressing rules and facts about some problem domain. Use programming languages which support this method such as Prolog, Answer Set Programming and Datalog."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/5b9cde20-f1b9-4adc-bfb3-dbf70b14138d", "label": "use object-oriented programming", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Utilise specialised ICT tools for programming paradigm based on the concept of objects, which can contain data in the form of fields and code in the form of procedures. Use programming languages which support this method such as JAVA and C++."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/75f839c2-fd9a-4ad3-8921-6e734608568d", "label": "use query languages", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Retrieve information from a database or information system using computer languages designed for the retrieval of data."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/8369c2d6-c100-4cf6-bd83-9668d8678433", "label": "utilise machine learning", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Use techniques and algorithms that are able to extract mastery out of data, learn from it and make predictions, to be used for program optimisation, application adaptation, pattern recognition, filtering, search engines and computer vision."}]}'::jsonb) on conflict(career_id,esco_version) do update set payload=excluded.payload, imported_at=now();
insert into public.career_skill_references(career_id,esco_version,payload) values ('cloud-engineer','1.2.1','{"career_id": "cloud-engineer", "esco_version": "1.2.1", "occupation_uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/349ee6f6-c295-4c38-9b98-48765b55280e", "occupation_label": "cloud engineer", "description": "Cloud engineers are responsible for the design, planning, management and maintenance of cloud-based systems. They develop and implement cloud-applications, handle the migration of existing on-premise applications to the cloud, and debug cloud stacks.", "source_url": "https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco/download", "archive_sha256": "f9761b0b52be1828b38a3e5e0ae59a93a7b0ce358bc800f52f57a8b002adeb3e", "mapping_note": "Team-selected related occupation; not an official equivalence or Malaysian demand evidence.", "skills": [{"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6fa1c2c0-a012-4ca0-9642-e01569ba322c", "label": "ICT system integration", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The principles of integrating ICT components and products from a number of sources to create an operational ICT system, techniques which ensure interoperability and interfaces between components and the system."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b105ec9b-0857-41d6-8d07-a83e58b73d90", "label": "ICT system programming", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The methods and tools required to develop system software, specifications of system architectures and interfacing techniques between network and system modules and components."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/2857540c-180b-4208-9127-e94a01871966", "label": "align software with system architectures", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Put system design and technical specifications in line with software architecture in order to ensure the integration and interoperability between components of the system."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b04f377b-ee80-4b38-aca1-19d266a23b17", "label": "analyse business requirements", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Study clients'' needs and expectations for a product or service in order to identify and resolve inconsistencies and possible disagreements of involved stakeholders."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f28617ad-afdd-4041-814c-216153a38998", "label": "analyse software specifications", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Assess the specifications of a software product or system to be developed by identifying functional and non-functional requirements, constraints and possible sets of use cases which illustrate interactions between the software and its users."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ce8ae6ca-61d8-4174-b457-641de96cbff4", "label": "automate cloud tasks", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Automate manual or repeatable processes to minimize management overhead. Evaluate cloud automation alternatives for network deployments and tool-based alternatives for network operations and management."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/8efa6a7a-6556-4cb8-908d-59d3b5c58d2f", "label": "cloud monitoring and reporting", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The metrics and alarms utilizing cloud monitoring services, in particular performance and availability metrics."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/1c2978b8-bb0d-4249-9c23-877571a4dffa", "label": "cloud security and compliance", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "Cloud security and compliance concepts, including shared responsibility model, cloud access management capabilities, and resources for security support."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/bd14968e-e409-45af-b362-3495ed7b10e0", "label": "cloud technologies", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The technologies which enable access to hardware, software, data and services through remote servers and software networks irrespective of their location and architecture."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/21d2f96d-35f7-4e3f-9745-c533d2dd6e97", "label": "computer programming", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms (e.g. object oriented programming, functional programming) and of programming languages."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/8088750d-8388-4170-a76f-48354c469c44", "label": "cyber security", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The methods and best practices that protect ICT systems, networks, computers, devices, services, processes and people against unauthorised access, modification and/or denial of service of assets."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/9ef0f3a0-9ce2-4ef1-a987-0366b5cb2dbe", "label": "database development tools", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The methodologies and tools used for creating logical and physical structure of databases, such as logical data structures, diagrams, modelling methodologies and entity-relationships."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/2522a6ce-3202-4ac8-9f5b-b9cb5a3a83a1", "label": "debug software", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Repair computer code by analysing testing results, locating the defects causing the software to output an incorrect or unexpected result and remove these faults."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6195c5f7-a4fb-425d-a3dd-c4467c4471a3", "label": "deploy cloud resource", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Identify and execute steps required to provision cloud resources, such as networks, servers, storage, applications, GPUs, and services. Define the cloud global infrastructure and remediate deployment issues."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/11430d93-c835-48ed-8e70-285fa69c9ae6", "label": "design cloud architecture", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Design a multi-tier cloud architecture solution, which tolerates faults and is fit for the workload and other business needs. Identify elastic and scalable computing solutions, select high-performing and scalable storage solutions, and choose high-performing database solutions. Identify cost-effective storage, computing, and database services in the cloud."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/4da4587a-fd0b-4ca2-886c-c42a1562d432", "label": "design cloud networks", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Apply cloud networking concepts and implement connectivity services of cloud. Given customer requirements, define network architectures on cloud, propose optimized designs based on the evaluation of an existing implementation. Evaluate and optimize cost allocations given a network design, its cloud resources, and application data flow."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7e796b51-49d7-4e73-95af-2e7323763f15", "label": "design database in the cloud", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Apply design principles for an adaptive, elastic, automated, loosely coupled databases making use of cloud infrastructure. Aim to remove any single point of failure through distributed database design."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/dfff95c6-9758-4c04-a228-7eaa88dec6cd", "label": "design for organisational complexity", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Determine cross-account authentication and access strategy for complex organizations (for example, an organization with varying compliance requirements, multiple business units, and varying scalability requirements). Design networks and multi-account cloud environments for complex organizations."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/797a4416-0b8d-44f3-8fcd-eb10bd0be6b4", "label": "develop software prototype", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Create a first incomplete or preliminary version of a piece of software application to simulate some specific aspects of the final product."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6b643893-0a1f-4f6c-83a1-e7eef75849b9", "label": "develop with cloud services", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Write code that interacts with cloud services by using APIs, SDKs, and cloud CLI. Write code for serverless applications, translate functional requirements into application design, implement application design into application code."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/38716afc-a93b-44ab-96cc-2ecf67edcf32", "label": "do cloud refactoring", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Optimise application to best use cloud services and features, migrate existing application code to run on cloud infrastructure."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c13fb093-5ffb-491a-b8b7-fa2d42a57e2e", "label": "implement cloud security and compliance", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Implement and manage security policies and access controls on cloud. Differentiate between the roles and responsibilities within the shared responsibility model."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/85c11255-469f-41bd-a6d1-382bc4a87783", "label": "interpret technical texts", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Read and understand technical texts that provide information on how to perform a task, usually explained in steps."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d3286405-49f8-4e8a-8046-a4376b4e7963", "label": "manage cloud data and storage", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Create and manage cloud data retention. Identify and implement data protection, encryption, and capacity planning needs."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/e5beeff8-7c98-490a-ae2c-16fbb6a87305", "label": "manage keys for data protection", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Select appropriate authentication and authorization mechanisms. Design, implement and troubleshoot key management and use. Design and implement a data encryption solution for data at rest and data in transit."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f9a6f35b-01a7-40c9-8b61-b6ee46f97272", "label": "operating systems", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The features, restrictions, architectures and other characteristics of operating systems such Linux, Windows, MacOS, etc."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/0a52bed5-fd29-45fb-aba6-e32bccfda1c1", "label": "plan migration to cloud", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Select existing workloads and processes for potential migration to the cloud and choose migration tools. Determine a new cloud architecture for an existing solution, plan a strategy for migrating existing workloads to the cloud."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/440d5784-52a5-4729-8b04-29f978bd896d", "label": "respond to incidents in cloud", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Troubleshoot issues with the cloud and determine how to restore operations. Design and automate disaster recovery strategies and evaluate a deployment for points of failure."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/83218cac-3599-417e-93d2-26013cdccd98", "label": "service-oriented modelling", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The principles and fundamentals of service-oriented modelling for business and software systems that allow the design and specification of service-oriented business systems within a variety of architectural styles, such as enterprise architecture and application architecture."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/9e06bac6-6b91-48ca-8b7d-c1f48cdecd7c", "label": "solve ICT system problems", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Identify potential component malfunctions. Monitor, document and communicate about incidents. Deploy appropriate resources with minimal outage and deploy appropriate diagnostic tools."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/09f2f811-a3fb-4de3-a70f-6420a6935575", "label": "systems development life-cycle", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The sequence of steps, such as planning, creating, testing and deploying and the models for the development and life-cycle management of a system."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/cdd8b6b2-2fd9-453c-8d62-8a1dc6efcd49", "label": "systems theory", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The principles that can be applied to all types of systems at all hierarchical levels, which describe the system''s internal organisation, its mechanisms of maintaining identity and stability and achieving adaptation and self-regulation and its dependencies and interaction with the environment."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f84a433f-34f1-4083-b0a3-24802623509c", "label": "web services", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "XML-based information systems that allows for direct interactions between applications through Internet. It is a set of protocols for transferring data between applications and systems."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/3ff589b7-68df-4ea5-ae41-b395bdb2378f", "label": "ICT security standards", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "Best practices and guidelines established for securing information and communication technology (ICT) systems and data. Standards as is the case of ISO 27000 series, provide a framework for implementing effective security controls, including access control, risk assessment and incident management, as well as to provide compliance of anorganisation."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/19a8293b-8e95-4de3-983f-77484079c389", "label": "Java (computer programming)", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Java."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ccd0a1d9-afda-43d9-b901-96344886e14d", "label": "Python (computer programming)", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Python."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/0ccdfe98-f845-4598-84a1-3dca66e9d9a3", "label": "Ruby (computer programming)", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and principles of software development, such as analysis, algorithms, coding, testing and compiling of programming paradigms in Ruby."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/cbe2c304-1e7d-489a-97d9-a7d3e37a9db6", "label": "apply ICT systems theory", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Implement principles of ICT systems theory in order to explain and document system characteristics that can be applied universally to other systems."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/96550830-539b-4746-96aa-92aa4959945d", "label": "apply risk management processes", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Identify risks and apply a risk management process, e.g. hazard analysis and critical control points (HACCP)."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/48db96bf-3314-45c6-bad8-fdb6e20e5639", "label": "data engineering", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The process of developing and constructing systems for implementing data collection and analysis at large scale."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/12274664-b642-4945-b88f-d7787dc3c9dd", "label": "design interaction model", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Design and develop an interaction model. Design a multi-turn conversation, use built-in intents and slots, handle unexpected conversational requests or responses, design multi-modal skills using one or more service interfaces (for example, audio, video, and gadgets)."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/cef5c0f8-1e40-4c09-b6a7-aa7811849e5d", "label": "ethics", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The philosophical study that deals with solving questions of human morality; it defines and systemises concepts such as right, wrong, and crime."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/2b92a5b2-6758-4ee3-9fb4-b6387a55cc8f", "label": "perform data analysis", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Collect data and statistics to test and evaluate in order to generate assertions and pattern predictions, with the aim of discovering useful information in a decision-making process."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6f1edc19-191f-4ba5-a048-ee69aff05bab", "label": "security engineering", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "Interdisciplinary field of study that focuses on the realisation of secure systems and the technology to protect individuals or information from malice, errors, or unauthorized access. It involves defining security protection requirements, processes, and methods to ensure the resilience of systems and data."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/75f839c2-fd9a-4ad3-8921-6e734608568d", "label": "use query languages", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Retrieve information from a database or information system using computer languages designed for the retrieval of data."}]}'::jsonb) on conflict(career_id,esco_version) do update set payload=excluded.payload, imported_at=now();
insert into public.career_skill_references(career_id,esco_version,payload) values ('financial-analyst','1.2.1','{"career_id": "financial-analyst", "esco_version": "1.2.1", "occupation_uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/8d586ee9-0ab1-4155-a3b0-2ca786c8e48c", "occupation_label": "financial analyst", "description": "Financial analysts conduct economic research and elicit valuable analyses on financial matters such as profitability, liquidity, solvency, and asset management. They provide recommendations on financial matters for decision-making processes. Financial analysts work in both the public and the private sector.", "source_url": "https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco/download", "archive_sha256": "f9761b0b52be1828b38a3e5e0ae59a93a7b0ce358bc800f52f57a8b002adeb3e", "mapping_note": "Team-selected related occupation; not an official equivalence or Malaysian demand evidence.", "skills": [{"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ecc18804-a466-40d9-98b4-fba5cd67dd4b", "label": "accounting", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The documentation and processing of data regarding financial activities."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/79c36c91-28a5-44b7-ab9b-7093b2d4b21e", "label": "advise on financial matters", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Consult, advise, and propose solutions with regards to financial management such as acquiring new assets, incurring in investments, and tax efficiency methods."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b02b38c4-d46d-44da-9479-1310060bd74d", "label": "asset management", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The process of increasing total wealth over time through investments that have potential to grow in value."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/98a1dec3-8138-4f46-a596-5e2a83b884b9", "label": "business analytics", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The disciplines and technologies for solving business problems through employing quantitative methods such as data analysis and statistical models."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/9e84a506-df06-4be3-874a-fa01293e3dd5", "label": "business processes", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "Processes which an organisation applies to improve efficiency, set new objectives and reach goals in a profitable and timely manner."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d41262ae-eca1-4ede-89a8-46d2d99a7a31", "label": "consider economic criteria in decision making", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Develop proposals and take appropriate decisions taking into account economic criteria."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/dd7c9dfd-6e2c-46fd-aefc-369402d0200c", "label": "create a financial report", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Finalise project accounting. Prepare an actual budget, compare the discrepancy between the planned and actual budget, and draw final conclusions."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/629685b8-5f9e-4522-8cff-b3e2c4ec625a", "label": "digital data processing", "relation": "essential", "type": "", "description": "Identify, locate, retrieve, store, organise and analyse digital information, judging its relevance and purpose."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/88af9294-b697-4687-ae19-aefbb6234dfa", "label": "economics", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "Economic principles and practices, financial and commodity markets, banking and the analysis of financial data."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f6ac6241-adb2-4ce2-b35f-09832cbb11ea", "label": "empirical analysis", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The evidence-based method that is used to analyse and interpret information with the aim of drawing conclusions about a specific issue."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/52e53619-fa77-4f72-b237-5e4aae784dc2", "label": "financial management", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The field of finance that concerns the practical process analysis and tools for designating financial resources. It encompasses the structure of businesses, the investment sources, and the value increase of corporations due to managerial decision-making."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/9c6974e1-8d8b-43e9-b6b0-75da7634bfc9", "label": "fundamental analysis", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques for measuring the intrinsic value of a financial security through the assessment its economic and financial factors. It combines together the analysis of macroeconomic trends and of financial statements of the companies."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/5f1d1319-7954-4a9b-90c7-57668e3a0d4b", "label": "interpret financial statements", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Read, understand, and interpret the key lines and indicators in financial statements. Extract the most important information from financial statements depending on the needs and integrate this information in the development of the department''s plans."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/49047409-9307-4b41-9b04-a9615f049044", "label": "investment banking", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The branch of banking that provides services of capital raising and mergers and acquisitions (M&A)."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d1910ad7-0c87-4f38-8a41-7c193e5dc16d", "label": "macroeconomics", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The economic field that studies the performance and behaviour of all the sectors of an economy aggregated. This field evaluates the financial performance of a country and considers indicator such as gross domestic product (GDP), price levels, unemployment rates, and inflation."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7cacd304-996d-47d1-88ef-4ddb9ce102bd", "label": "microeconomics", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The economic field that studies the behaviour and interactions between specific actors of the economy, namely consumers and firms. It is the field that analyses the decision-making process of individuals and the factors that influence purchasing decisions."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/e3c7bd87-edc1-4d9a-a3d5-36415de1aac6", "label": "offer financial services", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Provide a broad range of financial services to clients such as assistance with financial products, financial planning, insurances, money and investment management."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/27ed854c-15b8-4ba2-90e9-ae888a219703", "label": "perform business analysis", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Evaluate the condition of a business on its own and in relation to the competitive business domain, performing research, placing data in context of the business'' needs and determining areas of opportunity."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/0839eea4-c57b-4c14-b19b-923fbedb5d88", "label": "perform business research", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Search and collect information relevant for the development of businesses in different fields ranging from legal, accounting, finance, up to commercial matters."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d37bc902-f640-48d7-9db4-544db9aa65fa", "label": "prepare financial projections", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Gather financial data, exert analyses, and come up with financial projections for small and big businesses."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6360a934-cc87-4954-9656-b32db20592e3", "label": "quantitative analysis", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The technique of employing statistical and mathematical modelling and measurement to represent a specific reality through numbers."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7ee4c2ea-b349-4bd2-81a3-ec31475d4833", "label": "statistics", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The study of statistical theory, methods and practices such as collection, organisation, analysis, interpretation and presentation of data. It deals with all aspects of data including the planning of data collection in terms of the design of surveys and experiments in order to forecast and plan work-related activities."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/4b3ae518-6746-4487-8d3b-4cfc063a43d0", "label": "use business simulation tools", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Employ software to perform simulations to improve business skills such as business acumen, financial and market analysis and decision making."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/161a6c5a-593a-4977-b7b7-49c6a2a2f2a3", "label": "advise on tax planning", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Advise on appropriate strategies to include taxes in the overall financial plan in order to reduce the tax load. Advise on questions related to tax legislation and provide advise on the possible implications that decisions in financial matters can cause in a tax declaration. Advise on questions concerning things such as the creation of a company, investments, recruitments, or company successions."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/8a43795b-bb38-4f29-91df-a6c92ad4643c", "label": "analyse financial performance of a company", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Analyse the performance of the company in financial matters in order to identify improvement actions that could increase profit, based on accounts, records, financial statements and external information of the market."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/eb8babfb-ab91-4937-a032-6a79f82e9b7f", "label": "analyse financial risk", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Identify and analyse risks that could impact an organisation or individual financially, such as credit and market risks, and propose solutions to cover against those risks."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/e95058a6-e139-42e7-a470-72038a606649", "label": "assess financial viability", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Revise and analyse financial information and requirements of projects such as their budget appraisal, expected turnover, and risk assessment for determining the benefits and costs of the project. Assess if the agreement or project will redeem its investment, and whether the potential profit is worth the financial risk."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7d35602d-bc94-4975-aa7c-f4e8e05ce8e0", "label": "cost management", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The process of planning, monitoring and adjusting the expenses and revenues of a business in order to achieve cost efficiency and capability."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/56ff27ef-2565-45bf-a70c-f06d78d2a480", "label": "create a financial plan", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Develop a financial plan according to financial and client regulations, including an investor profile, financial advice, and negotiation and transaction plans."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/452c4c68-50d7-42ed-8c4e-b437446637d0", "label": "develop investment portfolio", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Create an investment portfolio for a customer that includes an insurance policy or multiple policies to cover specific risks, such as financial risks, assistance, reinsurance, industrial risks or natural and technical disasters."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/99c45fa5-093a-4fb9-b682-4ca46e552e33", "label": "develop transportation cost metrics", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Know various routing protocols to calculate itineraries. Compare different possible routes and determine the most efficient one. Understand topological and link-state databases."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/da629999-d226-4ff3-9e1a-01788132664f", "label": "ensure compliance with disclosure criteria of accounting information", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Revise the accounting information of the company to make sure it meets the commonly agreed criteria for its disclosure such as understandability, relevance, consistency, comparability, reliability, and objectivity."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/0f5bd097-ed76-47f7-8f44-93be67967b5f", "label": "explain financial jargon", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Explain all details of financial products in plain words to clients, including financial terms and all costs."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/4b2db903-cd8e-48ce-97fb-a92db4def54e", "label": "financial forecasting", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The tool used in performing fiscal financial management to identify revenue trends and estimated financial conditions."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/0bd4c62a-c309-467e-be76-8403b3f3a1a8", "label": "financial products", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The different types of instruments that apply to the management of cash flow that are available on the market, such as shares, bonds, options or funds."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/8b0f73ff-d36b-4196-bb83-464c3a6ef07d", "label": "game theory", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The study of mathematical models of strategic decisions among stakeholders. It has applications in all fields of social science, as well as in systems science, computer science and logic. Essential concepts are the Nash Equilibrium and the Prisoner''s Dilemma."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/86f0bb12-6491-4be7-8306-c88900e91a63", "label": "green bonds", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The financial instruments traded in financial markets that aim at raising capitals for projects with specific environmental benefits."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/7eb4c570-9dc7-4f4d-83d2-f4c4c87b6e49", "label": "handle mergers and acquisitions", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Handle the negotiation of financial deals and the legal implications involved in the purchase of a company by another or in the merging to separate companies."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c2617b44-886a-485e-8393-bc0fc6339539", "label": "management consulting", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The process of giving paid advice with the aim of improving businesses performance and promote their growth."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/075c68d7-efe4-4466-be4a-9acc726504df", "label": "mergers and acquisitions", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The process of joining together separate companies and relatively equal in size, and the purchase of a smaller company by a bigger one. The financial deals, the legal implications, and the consolidation of financial records and statements at the end of the fiscal year."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c35b19ad-b06f-44e8-be9f-c20c68750346", "label": "monitor loan portfolio", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Control the ongoing credit commitments in order to detect anomalies related to the schedules, refinancing, approval limits etc., and to identify improper disbursements."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b078d38c-7dd4-4efc-b333-7633d8bf6259", "label": "monitor stock market", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Observe and analyse the stock market and its trends on a daily basis to gather up-to-date information in order to develop investment strategies."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/48b68726-0fd6-4e03-a5eb-82236516ee7a", "label": "provide cost benefit analysis reports", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Prepare, compile and communicate reports with broken down cost analysis on the proposal and budget plans of the company. Analyse the financial or social costs and benefits of a project or investment in advance over a given period of time."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f4cd7802-123a-4bd5-9bfa-bf915a04e969", "label": "public offering", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The elements comprised in public offerings of companies in the stock market such as determining the initial public offering (IPO), the type of security, and the timing to launch it in the market."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b895bd42-0009-4815-a150-eb9eb5caec21", "label": "stock market", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The market in which shares of publicly held companies are issued and traded."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/203083ca-b051-4c28-8986-fc8731bacee5", "label": "sustainable finance", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The process of integrating environmental, social and governance (ESG) considerations when making business or investment decisions, leading to increased longer-term investments into sustainable economic activities and projects."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/0edaab25-1b72-4531-950d-d8b9a9f4a1c8", "label": "treasury management system", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The system for managing treasury processes by centralizing cash flow data linked to treasury operations. It involves managing the liquidity as well as money market instruments of an organisation."}]}'::jsonb) on conflict(career_id,esco_version) do update set payload=excluded.payload, imported_at=now();
insert into public.career_skill_references(career_id,esco_version,payload) values ('business-analyst','1.2.1','{"career_id": "business-analyst", "esco_version": "1.2.1", "occupation_uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/occupation/fe0fa514-b48d-4a53-9757-a283c0baacf0", "occupation_label": "ICT business analyst", "description": "ICT business analysts are in charge of analysing and designing an organisation''s processes and systems, assessing the business model and its integration with technology. They also identify change needs, assess the impact of the change, capture and document requirements and then ensure that these requirements are delivered whilst supporting the business through the implementation process.", "source_url": "https://esco.ec.europa.eu/en/use-esco/download", "archive_sha256": "f9761b0b52be1828b38a3e5e0ae59a93a7b0ce358bc800f52f57a8b002adeb3e", "mapping_note": "Team-selected related occupation; not an official equivalence or Malaysian demand evidence.", "skills": [{"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/56042303-972b-41be-9310-58467599ff7e", "label": "analyse business processes", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Study the contribution of the work processes to the business goals and monitor their efficiency and productivity."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b04f377b-ee80-4b38-aca1-19d266a23b17", "label": "analyse business requirements", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Study clients'' needs and expectations for a product or service in order to identify and resolve inconsistencies and possible disagreements of involved stakeholders."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/9714735d-6f60-440b-bdbc-aaf45ebcbe78", "label": "analyse the context of an organisation", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Study the external and internal environment of an organisation by identifying its strengths and weaknesses in order to provide a base for company strategies and further planning."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/3c03ee71-4a23-448f-b79e-81fd75d27dca", "label": "apply change management", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Manage development within an organisation by anticipating changes and making managerial decisions to ensure that the members involved are as less disturbed as possible."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/98301d4a-2cc3-439d-8d7f-0b6ac76302bb", "label": "business process modelling", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The tools, methods and notations such as Business Process Model and Notation (BPMN) and Business Process Execution Language (BPEL), used to describe and analyse the characteristics of a business process and model its further development."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/0ee94c0a-3716-494a-95a2-dcbab9e58be2", "label": "business requirements techniques", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The procedures required to identify and analyse business and organisational needs."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/6a7792a9-888a-46ad-afc9-2c0d94c8fde6", "label": "create business process models", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Develop formal and informal descriptions of the business processes and the organisational structure by using business process models, notations and tools."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/d9e5349e-8791-49c2-8ba4-839fdd1606c2", "label": "define technical requirements", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Specify technical properties of goods, materials, methods, processes, services, systems, software and functionalities by identifying and responding to the particular needs that are to be satisfied according to customer requirements."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/397da142-ab35-48fe-b154-7c38f447adfb", "label": "digital systems", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "Systems to store, process and spread information in digital form. They are hardware, software and networks, as well as the ways in which these can be employed."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/0e0c9c11-b39e-43cf-ba95-2fe646f5de64", "label": "identify customer requirements", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Apply techniques and tools, such as surveys, questionnaires, ICT applications, for eliciting, defining, analysing, documenting and maintaining user requirements from system, service or product."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/b9bf9e17-ae47-417b-bbb1-e8b7c263ccac", "label": "identify legal requirements", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Conduct research for applicable legal and normative procedures and standards, analyse and derive legal requirements that apply to the organisation, its policies and products."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/f7b5d916-52f0-4865-b6a6-e1a3b711cb5e", "label": "implement strategic planning", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Take action on the goals and procedures defined at a strategic level in order to mobilise resources and pursue the established strategies."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/a8797f21-1af0-4c5e-98ca-bf1442929363", "label": "interact with users to gather requirements", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Communicate with users to identify their requirements and collect them. Define all relevant user requirements and document them in an understandable and logical way for further analysis and specification."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/a846cb9e-c152-41e7-bd34-45e7ff941e3b", "label": "legal requirements of ICT products", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The international regulations related to the development and use of ICT products."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/4913d0c0-133a-4c46-aac3-f5d4989a982e", "label": "product usage risks analysis", "relation": "essential", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The methods to analyse product associated risks, in possible customer environment, their magnitude, consequences and likely outcomes in order to mitigate them by warning messages, safety instructions and maintenance support."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/07e51c60-763a-4335-b4ec-70a15f66d328", "label": "propose ICT solutions to business problems", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Suggest how to solve business issues, using ICT means, so that business processes are improved."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/48b68726-0fd6-4e03-a5eb-82236516ee7a", "label": "provide cost benefit analysis reports", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Prepare, compile and communicate reports with broken down cost analysis on the proposal and budget plans of the company. Analyse the financial or social costs and benefits of a project or investment in advance over a given period of time."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/2d6d4784-0992-48e7-b100-22d7229b3f0a", "label": "translate requirements into visual design", "relation": "essential", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Develop visual design from given specifications and requirements, based on the analysis of the scope and target audience. Create a visual representation of ideas such as logos, website graphics, digital games and layouts."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/e5609f89-0daf-40bb-bd6b-94f5d7498131", "label": "ICT market", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The processes, stakeholders and the dynamics of the chain of goods and services in the ICT market sector."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/ccdbd9bb-4faf-403c-a968-e8bf487f8a53", "label": "business ICT systems", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The software packages, hardware devices and new technologies used in supporting business processes such as enterprise resource planning (ERP), customer relationship management (CRM), mobile devices and network solutions."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/143769cb-b61e-47d8-a61e-eedfbec1016c", "label": "business intelligence", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The tools used to transform large amounts of raw data into relevant and helpful business information."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/bd698bbe-7003-4508-b422-46c2ff4d5e95", "label": "business strategy concepts", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The terminology related to the design and implementation of major trends and aims which are taken by an organisation''s executives, while keeping in mind its resources, competition and environments."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/bd14968e-e409-45af-b362-3495ed7b10e0", "label": "cloud technologies", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The technologies which enable access to hardware, software, data and services through remote servers and software networks irrespective of their location and architecture."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/3ce1fe19-7f9e-4070-941d-651673a5693b", "label": "decision support systems", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The ICT systems that can be used to support business or organisational decision making."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/2c28fc20-8a60-4311-8899-5ef8729c05b3", "label": "design process", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Identify the workflow and resource requirements for a particular process, using a variety of tools such as process simulation software, flowcharting and scale models."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/31c69100-b612-4a61-8db5-fd314318854c", "label": "execute analytical mathematical calculations", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Apply mathematical methods and make use of calculation technologies in order to perform analyses and devise solutions to specific problems."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/1bba98a7-92b9-450b-9235-e0c905f8f3c4", "label": "information architecture", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The methods through which information is generated, structured, stored, maintained, linked, exchanged and used."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/93aaf65c-5aad-4e6f-a7ba-ce9bf7c0e6e6", "label": "information categorisation", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The process of classifying the information into categories and showing relationships between the data for some clearly defined purposes."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/696e3b5b-8b61-45af-ae4c-3ab700f197ec", "label": "information extraction", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques and methods used for eliciting and extracting information from unstructured or semi-structured digital documents and sources."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/2fb8480e-de3c-462b-b169-e8bbb344da68", "label": "innovation processes", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The techniques, models, methods and strategies which contribute to the promotion of steps towards innovation."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/0daaf096-1639-461c-bf1a-bbeea77e6b67", "label": "internal risk management policy", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The internal risk management policies that identify, assess and prioritise risks in an IT environment. The methods used to minimise, monitor and control the possibility and the impact of disastrous events that affect the reaching of business goals."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/3c76296d-4bbd-44ba-8eaa-95bf275f79b7", "label": "manage ICT project", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Plan, organize, control and document procedures and resources, such as human capital, equipment and mastery, in order to achieve specific goals and objectives related to ICT systems, services or products, within specific constraints, such as scope, time, quality and budget."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/79f24a62-7718-46e1-9b41-37be0560a5ca", "label": "organisational resilience", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The strategies, methods and techniques that increase the organisation''s capacity to protect and sustain the services and operations that fulfil the organisational mission and create lasting values by effectively addressing the combined issues of security, preparedness, risk and disaster recovery."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/385479b7-5da5-4367-9763-0d15b41bb65b", "label": "provide user documentation", "relation": "optional", "type": "skill/competence", "description": "Develop and organise the distribution of structured documents to assist people using a particular product or system, such as written or visual information about an application system and how to use it."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/09f2f811-a3fb-4de3-a70f-6420a6935575", "label": "systems development life-cycle", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The sequence of steps, such as planning, creating, testing and deploying and the models for the development and life-cycle management of a system."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/c5e8abde-d2ba-4e8e-a65e-720b71180666", "label": "unstructured data", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The information that is not arranged in a pre-defined manner or does not have a pre-defined data model and is difficult to understand and find patterns in without using techniques such as data mining."}, {"uri": "http://data.europa.eu/esco/skill/348b74cd-49ce-4844-8bdf-ec188b497213", "label": "visual presentation techniques", "relation": "optional", "type": "knowledge", "description": "The visual representation and interaction techniques, such as histograms, scatter plots, surface plots, tree maps and parallel coordinate plots, that can be used to present abstract numerical and non-numerical data, in order to reinforce the human understanding of this information."}]}'::jsonb) on conflict(career_id,esco_version) do update set payload=excluded.payload, imported_at=now();
commit;
